data: {"id": "8e73a38219d04a7c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1703", "run_id": "8e73a38219d04a7c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集证据汇总（namespace=aiops-case-10, pod=workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r, UID f0496f24-4504-47ae-8b6d-685bd1536991）：\n\n**1. 实体状态**\n- **事实**：Pod 当前处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启计数已达 19 次（kubectl_get_yaml 最新结果），`0/1 Ready`。\n- **事实**：容器名为 `app`，镜像为 `python:3-alpine`，CPU 限制 200m，内存限制 96Mi。\n- **事实**：`Last Exit Code: 137`，`Reason: Error`，状态为 `Waiting`（等待重试）。\n\n**2. 崩溃原因分析（退出码 137 & CrashLoopBackOff）**\n- **支持 OOMKilled 的证据**：\n    - 退出码 137 通常对应 `SIGKILL`，在 Kubernetes 中常因容器达到内存限制（96Mi）而被 OOM Killer 终止。\n    - Prometheus 指", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1789355837812, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

